 result←object(State Icon)arg;item;icon;r;c;objname
 result←⍬
⍝ 'Icon' ([n] m ⍴ icon [r c]) ... ⍝ icon may be a file name or an icon handle

 :If 1 ¯2∊⍨≡arg ⋄ arg←,⊂arg ⋄ :EndIf
 '∆WI RANK ERROR: Icon'##.Error∨/2<≢¨⍴¨arg
 '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Icon'##.Error∨/~(⊢/¨⍴¨arg)∊¨⊂1 3 5
 arg←⊃,/,¨↓¨arg ⍝ If any items are matrices, split them into individual lines so we can process them sequentially

 :For item :In arg
     :If (1≥|≡item)∧~##.IsNum⊃item ⋄ item←,⊂item ⋄ :EndIf
     (icon r c)←item,item≢⍛↓'' 0 0
     'DOMAIN ERROR'##.Error~∧/##.IsInt¨r c
     'DOMAIN ERROR'##.Error∨/(1≠≢¨r c)∨1<≢¨⍴¨r c
     :If ##.IsInt icon ⍝ This better be an icon handle
     :AndIf 1=≢icon
         objname←('Icon'GetHandle icon).ObjName ⍝ Retrieve Icon name from stored handle
     :ElseIf (##.IsChar icon)∧'>'∊icon ⍝ This is an icon resource ⍝? Does this need more thorough validation?
         ##.Error'Icon resources are not supported yet' ⍝? Add this later
     :ElseIf ##.IsChar icon ⍝ This is an icon file name
         '∆WI RANK ERROR: Icon'##.Error 1<≢⍴icon←1/icon
         :If '.ico'≡⍥⎕C ¯4↑icon ⍝ We're only accepting .ICO files ⍝? May do more later
         :AndIf ⎕NEXISTS icon
             State.IconObj←objname←(object⍕⍛,'.',##.Next object)##.∆WC'Icon'('File'icon)('Style' 'Large') ⍝ We'll create an Icon object
⍝? Does this need to be preserved out of this fn at all since it's an immediate-pixel-update rendering operation now?
         :Else
             ##.Error'∆WI DRAW ERROR: Invalid or missing icon file "',icon,'"'
         :EndIf
     :Else
         ##.Error'∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Icon'
     :EndIf
     State GUI'Icon'('Icon'objname)('Points'r c) ⍝ Use special code and pseudo-property to write this sort of object
 :EndFor
